all <u>seven</u> house layouts to deliver presents in record time.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOU BETTER WATCH OUT</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/ecb7980c15aee7fb93bf5a44e56076ff.poster.avif?t=1693868013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/ecb7980c15aee7fb93bf5a44e56076ff.webm?t=1693868013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/ecb7980c15aee7fb93bf5a44e56076ff.mp4?t=1693868013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Make your way through fake houses, past fake robot residents, and place some fake presents. Be sure to:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tiptoe to be quiet<br></li><li> Avoid training robots<br></li><li> Place presents<br></li><li> Safely escape the house</li></ul> <strong>And most importantly</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be extra stealthy</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRAINING ROBOTS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/c8f39c9ed054de6361c0fa85a1a55201.poster.avif?t=1693868013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/c8f39c9ed054de6361c0fa85a1a55201.webm?t=1693868013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482830/extras/c8f39c9ed054de6361c0fa85a1a55201.mp4?t=1693868013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Make sure you avoid:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Watchers - tiptoe past them when their head is buried in a book<br></li><li> Sleepers - quietly place presents in the stockings at the foot of their bed<br></li><li> And Patrollers - wait until their back is turned before making a run for it!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEADERBOARDS</h2>Can you be the stealthiest Santa in the world? Only one way to find out - get clocking some scores on the Steam leaderboards now!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOW WITH TILT FIVE\u2122 SUPPORT!</h2>Immerse yourself as the stealthiest Santa of all! Use the Tilt Five\u2122 glasses to get a birds-eye view on each of the training houses that our Santa needs to sneak through, and control Santa himself using the Tilt Five\u2122 wand, making your way through each room and corridor, dropping off presents and filling stockings as you go. Find out more at Tilt Five's website.",
